# `yo fix` applies the repairs the compiler already computed
# (plans/LLM_FRIENDLY_TOOLCHAIN_AND_SYNTAX.md §2). `countr` is one deletion
# away from `counter`, so the not-found diagnostic already carries a unique
# "did you mean" — this case proves the suggestion is now a STRUCTURED repair
# the tool can apply, not just prose for a human to re-type.
#
# The `expected_tree` golden is the real assertion: it hashes main.yo AFTER
# the rewrite, so a fix that edits the wrong span, the wrong line, or mangles
# the rest of the file fails here even though stdout would look right.
stdout_keep=^fix:
timeout=180
